// Settings -> Access (epic memql#5289, task memql#5307): the screen where a
// grant to a person or a group is written and read back. Seeded on the roles
// the grant READS admit -- grantsForSubject and grantsForResource are floored
// at admin, so admin, developer and owner -- rather than on the roles that
// may WRITE one (update on principal: owner and admin). A developer opens the
// screen and reads it; the writes go read-only in the shell and are refused
// in Go (grant_caller_not_permitted) for anybody below that grant.
