// =============================================================================
//   The Deployables parts (task memql#5301; design section 2, "Deployables,
//   the first app to carry the vocabulary"). Seeded on owner and developer
//   ONLY -- the two roles that deploy today -- and `execute`, because a part
//   is an ACTION: a construct that belongs to exactly one part declares
//   @requiresCapability("execute", "app:deployables/<part>"). A read shared
//   by several apps (sitesAll, siteById) carries no app annotation and is
//   governed by row authorization alone (D8).
// =============================================================================

// ---- app:deployables/sources -- add or edit a source, its credential, its auto-deploy switch ----
@description("owner: the sources part of the Deployables app -- add or edit a source, its credential, its auto-deploy switch (memql#5301).")
